00:33:06.190 --> 00:33:09.190
And also, maybe something
else I wanted to add

00:33:09.190 --> 00:33:12.010
is about machine
learning in Africa.

00:33:12.010 --> 00:33:16.030
I think now is the time to
prove to the world as Africans

00:33:16.030 --> 00:33:20.230
that we can raise, that
even companies out of Africa

00:33:20.230 --> 00:33:23.380
can be competitive,
can stand on their feet

00:33:23.380 --> 00:33:27.940
