the 21st century.

00:33:33.020 --> 00:33:35.230
That's what we're trying
to do at InstaDeep.

00:33:35.230 --> 00:33:40.120
And if I had a wish, it's to
see in the future successful AI

00:33:40.120 --> 00:33:43.120
companies emerging from
Africa with the help

00:33:43.120 --> 00:33:45.880
